    "description": "<p>NeuroLibre JupyterBook built at this <a href=\"https://github.com/roboneurolibre/fmriprep-denoise-benchmark/commit/b568759fd2cbf9b27ef170a9c9984aaaf0de40a3\"> reference repository/commit by roboneuro</a>, based on the <a href=\"https://github.com/SIMEXP/fmriprep-denoise-benchmark/commit/02f2fa2a0b26b3624a9108e8d600ff4c64047d5c\">latest change by the author</a>.</p>\n\n<p>For details, please visit the corresponding <a href=\"https://github.com/neurolibre/neurolibre-reviews/issues/12\">NeuroLibre technical screening.</a></p>\n\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://neurolibre.org\">https://neurolibre.org</a></strong></p>"
